# Memory Brain (this .gitignore is relative to memory/):
# version the meaningful, bounded learning state (episodes, mistakes, semantic,
# statistical/pattern reports, prediction ledger) so it PERSISTS across CI runs
# and settles over time. Exclude only the unbounded raw audit stream, the
# ephemeral working context, and the idempotency marker.
archive/raw.jsonl
working/last-context.json
.lastgen
# never track stray temp/lock files
*.tmp
.DS_Store
